/**
 * Tests for {@link JPEGLosslessDecoder#decode()}.
 * <p>
 * The tests build minimal, spec conformant lossless (SOF3) JPEG streams, so that the expected
 * sample values can be derived directly from the JPEG lossless (ISO/IEC 10918-1, Annex H) rules:
 * the first sample of a scan (or restart interval) is predicted as {@code 2^(P-Pt-1)}, and every
 * following sample is predicted from the already decoded neighbours, with the decoded difference
 * added to the prediction.
