/**
 * Tests for {@link MacroBlock#predictUV(VP8Frame)}.
 * <p>
 * The {@link VP8Frame} lookup of neighbouring macro blocks is arranged through
 * reflection, so that the prediction method can be driven deterministically
 * without decoding an actual WebP bitstream.
